  "description": "Kateru is a bold and playful display font designed to bring a fun, friendly, and delicious personality to your visual projects. Featuring chunky rounded shapes, soft curves, and an expressive character, Kateru creates an instantly recognizable look that works beautifully for food and lifestyle branding.\nInspired by the energetic visual language of Japanese food culture, Kateru is perfect for ramen shops, sushi restaurants, Japanese cafés, bakery brands, snack packaging, food labels, menus, posters, and promotional campaigns. Its bold silhouette remains highly visible across both large headlines and compact branding applications.\nKateru is also a versatile choice for packaging design, logos, merchandise, social media graphics, stickers, children’s products, mascot branding, and playful editorial layouts. Whether you are creating a Japanese-inspired food identity or a colorful contemporary brand, Kateru adds a warm, cheerful, and memorable visual personality to your design.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Kateru is a bold and playful display font designed to bring a fun, friendly, and delicious personality to your visual projects. Featuring chunky rounded shapes, soft curves, and an expressive character, Kateru creates an instantly recognizable look that works beautifully for food and lifestyle branding.</p>\n<p>Inspired by the energetic visual language of Japanese food culture, Kateru is perfect for ramen shops, sushi restaurants, Japanese cafés, bakery brands, snack packaging, food labels, menus, posters, and promotional campaigns. Its bold silhouette remains highly visible across both large headlines and compact branding applications.</p>\n<p>Kateru is also a versatile choice for packaging design, logos, merchandise, social media graphics, stickers, children’s products, mascot branding, and playful editorial layouts. Whether you are creating a Japanese-inspired food identity or a colorful contemporary brand, Kateru adds a warm, cheerful, and memorable visual personality to your design.</p>",
